          "Our enterprise platform architecture enforces a strict four-gate validation pipeline: Gate 1 verifies that semantic extraction achieves at least 95.0% entity recall across diverse resume layouts; Gate 2 scans feature vectors to confirm zero proxy variable contamination; Gate 3 calculates the Adverse Impact Ratio (AIR) across all protected demographic groups; and Gate 4 automatically engages threshold tuning or human recruiter escalation whenever AIR dips below 0.82 (a 0.02 safety buffer above the 0.80 four-fifths benchmark).",
