          "The Enterprise AI Governance, Security & Evals Control Tower marks the ultimate architectural synthesis of Milestone 3. In enterprise environments, artificial intelligence cannot operate as isolated black boxes; it requires a unified, real-time command plane that continuously synthesizes threat defenses, adversarial resilience, factual accuracy, and statutory compliance into an auditable executive score.",
          "The Control Tower orchestrates four foundational pillars: Pillar 1 real-time OWASP threat defenses that intercept prompt injection and data exfiltration at runtime; Pillar 2 automated red-team fuzzing that stress-tests agent workflows against adversarial mutation matrices; Pillar 3 multi-dimensional golden dataset evals and RAG Triad telemetry that help verify factual faithfulness and low latency; and Pillar 4 statutory compliance engines that enforce EU AI Act mandates, ISO 42001 controls, and EEOC algorithmic fairness ratios.",
