        "example": "Worked example: four swarm handoffs all succeed (100% success) with an average latency of 86.25 ms, under the 120 ms target and above the 98% success floor, so fabric_coherence_verified is true and the pillar earns the full 25.0 points.",
        "code": "import json\nfrom dataclasses import dataclass, asdict\nfrom typing import List, Dict\n\n@dataclass\nclass SwarmTaskHandoff:\n    task_id: str\n    origin_swarm: str\n    target_swarm: str\n    payload_token_count: int\n    execution_time_ms: float\n    success: bool\n\n@dataclass\nclass Pillar1Telemetry:\n    pillar_id: str = 'Pillar_1_Cognitive_Agent_Swarms'\n    total_tasks_processed: int = 0\n    success_rate_pct: float = 0.0\n    avg_latency_ms: float = 0.0\n    fabric_coherence_verified: bool = False\n    pillar_score: float = 0.0  # Max 25.0 pts\n\nclass Pillar1CognitiveSwarmEngine:\n    def __init__(self, target_latency_ms: float = 120.0, min_success_rate: float = 98.0):\n        self.target_latency = target_latency_ms\n        self.min_success = min_success_rate\n\n    def evaluate_swarm_fabric(self, handoffs: List[SwarmTaskHandoff]) -> Pillar1Telemetry:\n        total = len(handoffs)\n        if total == 0:\n            return Pillar1Telemetry()\n            \n        successful = sum(1 for h in handoffs if h.success)\n        success_rate = (successful / total) * 100.0\n        avg_latency = sum(h.execution_time_ms for h in handoffs) / total\n        \n        coherence = (success_rate >= self.min_success) and (avg_latency <= self.target_latency)\n        score = 25.0 if coherence else round((success_rate / 100.0) * 20.0, 1)\n        \n        return Pillar1Telemetry(\n            total_tasks_processed=total,\n            success_rate_pct=round(success_rate, 2),\n            avg_latency_ms=round(avg_latency, 2),\n            fabric_coherence_verified=coherence,\n            pillar_score=score\n        )\n\n# Test execution\ntest_handoffs = [\n    SwarmTaskHandoff('TSK-SW-01', 'Customer_Engagement_Swarm', 'Financial_Ledger_Swarm', 450, 85.0, True),\n    SwarmTaskHandoff('TSK-SW-02', 'Financial_Ledger_Swarm', 'Logistics_Operations_Swarm', 320, 105.0, True),\n    SwarmTaskHandoff('TSK-SW-03', 'Logistics_Operations_Swarm', 'Audit_Compliance_Swarm', 610, 95.0, True),\n    SwarmTaskHandoff('TSK-SW-04', 'Audit_Compliance_Swarm', 'Executive_Dashboard_Swarm', 210, 60.0, True)\n]\nengine1 = Pillar1CognitiveSwarmEngine()\ntelem1 = engine1.evaluate_swarm_fabric(test_handoffs)\nprint(json.dumps(asdict(telem1), indent=2))\n",
