          "why": "Without a circuit breaker, an autonomous supervisor trapped in an error condition will continuously bombard failing workers with retries, saturating network connections and wasting API budgets. The circuit breaker trips open to arrest failure cascading and initiate fallback routing.",
          "explanation": "Without a circuit breaker, an autonomous supervisor trapped in an error condition will continuously bombard failing workers with retries, saturating network connections and wasting API budgets. The circuit breaker trips open to arrest failure cascading and initiate fallback routing."
