        "tryIt": "Before the final print, add t3 = kg_builder.extract_and_ingest_triplet('AAPL', 'INVESTS_IN', 'NVDA', 0.90, 'DOC-PR-2026-03', {'stake': 'minority'}) and print(t3). The builder resolves 'AAPL' to ENT-APPL and 'NVDA' to ENT-NVDA and returns the triplet '(Apple Inc.) -[INVESTS_IN]-> (Nvidia Corporation)' without creating new nodes.",
