    "minutes": 45,
    "recap": "Over Days 46 to 49, we mastered the core disciplines of high-performance LLMOps: vLLM continuous batching on Day 46, speculative latency decoding on Day 47, embedded edge micro-engines on Day 48, and OpenTelemetry token FinOps on Day 49. Today on Day 50, we assemble these pillars into the Milestone 10 Capstone: The Sub-Second Global AI Routing Gateway & Dynamic Tiering Mesh.",
