          "In this masterclass capstone module, you assume the role of Chief AI FinOps Officer for Apex Global Holdings Inc., a Fortune 100 enterprise processing over 50,000,000 monthly cognitive transactions across global commercial banking, capital markets, statutory auditing, and retail customer operations. Uncontrolled generative AI usage has pushed annual cloud projected expenditures past $18,000,000, triggering an urgent mandate from the Chief Financial Officer and Board Audit Committee to construct an integrated, centralized FinOps Master Control Cockpit.",
