          "In this masterclass capstone, you assume the executive office of Chief Information Security Officer and Executive Board Fiduciary Director for Apex Financial Technologies (AFT), a publicly traded global fintech conglomerate processing $3.2 trillion in annual electronic securities transactions, currency settlements, and asset management portfolios. AFT's entire trading edge is powered by proprietary cognitive foundation models and real-time GraphRAG knowledge bases.",
          "At 03:14 UTC, a coordinated multi-vector cyber attack strikes AFT's production cognitive infrastructure. A sophisticated nation-state threat group combines an indirect prompt injection exploit via a counterparty payment ledger with an attempt to trigger a dormant trojan backdoor in the corporate fraud scoring model, while attempting to exfiltrate proprietary algorithmic trading weights. Your mission is to orchestrate, execute, and certify the Enterprise Cognitive Incident Response Engine (ECIRE-v1).",
