        "example": "Consider a global Fortune 100 enterprise generating $65B across manufacturing, logistics, and retail. Operating across 32 regional ERPs and fragmented legacy systems, corporate decision cycle times average 24 days. Deployed under AEOS v2, the unified cognitive operating system integrates 14,000 live data feeds, enabling real-time cross-functional synchronization in 65 milliseconds—unlocking $1.2B in annualized working capital efficiency.",
        "code": "import json\nimport hashlib\nfrom dataclasses import dataclass, field, asdict\nfrom typing import List, Dict, Optional\n\n@dataclass\nclass AEOSSubsystemStatus:\n    tier_name: str\n    subsystem_id: str\n    operational_health: str # 'HEALTHY_ATTESTED', 'DEGRADED', 'QUARANTINED'\n    latency_p99_ms: float\n    cryptographic_integrity_verified: bool\n    active_agent_count: int\n\n@dataclass\nclass AEOSSystemBaselineReport:\n    aeos_version: str\n    enterprise_name: str\n    total_active_subsystems: int\n    all_tiers_attested: bool\n    aggregate_system_latency_ms: float\n    subsystem_telemetry: List[AEOSSubsystemStatus]\n    fiduciary_compliance_rating: str\n\nclass AutonomousEnterpriseOSMasterController:\n    VERSION = \"AEOS-v2.0-SOVEREIGN-ENTERPRISE\"\n\n    def initialize_and_audit_aeos(\n        self,\n        enterprise_name: str,\n        subsystems: List[AEOSSubsystemStatus]\n    ) -> AEOSSystemBaselineReport:\n        all_healthy = all(s.operational_health == 'HEALTHY_ATTESTED' and s.cryptographic_integrity_verified for s in subsystems)\n        avg_latency = sum(s.latency_p99_ms for s in subsystems) / max(1, len(subsystems))\n        \n        status_rating = 'AAA_SOVEREIGN_FIDUCIARY_GRADE' if all_healthy else 'OPERATIONAL_RISK_FLAGGED'\n        \n        return AEOSSystemBaselineReport(\n            aeos_version=self.VERSION,\n            enterprise_name=enterprise_name,\n            total_active_subsystems=len(subsystems),\n            all_tiers_attested=all_healthy,\n            aggregate_system_latency_ms=round(avg_latency, 2),\n            subsystem_telemetry=subsystems,\n            fiduciary_compliance_rating=status_rating\n        )\n\n# Execution: Initialize and audit the 4 core tiers of AEOS v2 for a global conglomerate\ncontroller = AutonomousEnterpriseOSMasterController()\nsubsystems = [\n    AEOSSubsystemStatus('Tier 1: Sovereign Hardware', 'SUB-DGX-FIPS-01', 'HEALTHY_ATTESTED', 1.2, True, 8),\n    AEOSSubsystemStatus('Tier 2: Cognitive Retrieval Mesh', 'SUB-VECTOR-RAG-02', 'HEALTHY_ATTESTED', 2.8, True, 12),\n    AEOSSubsystemStatus('Tier 3: Autonomous Agent Mesh', 'SUB-AGENT-MESH-03', 'HEALTHY_ATTESTED', 14.5, True, 24),\n    AEOSSubsystemStatus('Tier 4: Boardroom Governance', 'SUB-GOV-AUDIT-04', 'HEALTHY_ATTESTED', 4.1, True, 6)\n]\n\nreport = controller.initialize_and_audit_aeos('Titan Global Holdings AG', subsystems)\nprint(json.dumps({'aeos_master_baseline_audit': asdict(report)}, indent=2))\n",
        "output": "{\n  \"aeos_master_baseline_audit\": {\n    \"aeos_version\": \"AEOS-v2.0-SOVEREIGN-ENTERPRISE\",\n    \"enterprise_name\": \"Titan Global Holdings AG\",\n    \"total_active_subsystems\": 4,\n    \"all_tiers_attested\": true,\n    \"aggregate_system_latency_ms\": 5.65,\n    \"subsystem_telemetry\": [\n      {\n        \"tier_name\": \"Tier 1: Sovereign Hardware\",\n        \"subsystem_id\": \"SUB-DGX-FIPS-01\",\n        \"operational_health\": \"HEALTHY_ATTESTED\",\n        \"latency_p99_ms\": 1.2,\n        \"cryptographic_integrity_verified\": true,\n        \"active_agent_count\": 8\n      },\n      {\n        \"tier_name\": \"Tier 2: Cognitive Retrieval Mesh\",\n        \"subsystem_id\": \"SUB-VECTOR-RAG-02\",\n        \"operational_health\": \"HEALTHY_ATTESTED\",\n        \"latency_p99_ms\": 2.8,\n        \"cryptographic_integrity_verified\": true,\n        \"active_agent_count\": 12\n      },\n      {\n        \"tier_name\": \"Tier 3: Autonomous Agent Mesh\",\n        \"subsystem_id\": \"SUB-AGENT-MESH-03\",\n        \"operational_health\": \"HEALTHY_ATTESTED\",\n        \"latency_p99_ms\": 14.5,\n        \"cryptographic_integrity_verified\": true,\n        \"active_agent_count\": 24\n      },\n      {\n        \"tier_name\": \"Tier 4: Boardroom Governance\",\n        \"subsystem_id\": \"SUB-GOV-AUDIT-04\",\n        \"operational_health\": \"HEALTHY_ATTESTED\",\n        \"latency_p99_ms\": 4.1,\n        \"cryptographic_integrity_verified\": true,\n        \"active_agent_count\": 6\n      }\n    ],\n    \"fiduciary_compliance_rating\": \"AAA_SOVEREIGN_FIDUCIARY_GRADE\"\n  }\n}\n",
